# No domain yet? You can use a free sslip.io hostname that encodes your VM's
# IP right in it — e.g. if your VM's external IP is 34.123.45.67, use:
#   34-123-45-67.sslip.io
# It already resolves to that IP with zero DNS setup, and Let's Encrypt
# (which Caddy uses automatically below) will issue a real cert for it.

